# Hydromart internal sweeps (busybox crond). Times are the container's TZ (UTC by
# default — set TZ on the scheduler service to shift). Logs go to the container.
#
# Place orders for all due recurring subscriptions — hourly.
0 * * * * sh /scripts/sweep.sh subscriptions/process-due
# "Time to refill" reorder reminders — daily at 08:00.
0 8 * * * sh /scripts/sweep.sh orders/reminders/reorder
# Retention enforcement (M23-21): runs the policy for every dataset that has an executor
# — including proof-of-delivery, which used to sweep itself at 03:15 off a separate
# per-depot window. One owner for the rule now. Datasets with no executor are logged as
# such. Daily at 03:30, after the 03:00 database backup, so a bad delete is always
# recoverable from that night's dump.
30 3 * * * sh /scripts/sweep.sh retention/internal/purge admin:3017
